<figure id="A1.F5.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2509.22638v1/FD-CFT.svg" id="A1.F5.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:548/380;" width="548" height="380"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>CFT (<em id="A1.F5.sf2.3" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">forward dynamics</em>)</figcaption>
